%N A398240 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of simple graphs on n unlabeled vertices with feedback vertex set number k, 0 <= k < n.
%C A398240 The feedback vertex set number can also be called the decycling number. It is the minimum number of vertices that need to be removed from the graph to make it acyclic.
%C A398240 For complete graphs with n >= 3 vertices the feedback vertex set number is n - 2.
%H A398240 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/FeedbackVertexSetNumber.html">Feedback Vertex Set Number</a>.
